% before relying on it. It is not legal, tax, insurance, financial or other
% professional advice. Its authors accept no liability for any loss or damage
% arising from its use.

the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 4.

the events are:
    the contract simple delivery obligation starts on day *a day*; known as contract_simple_delivery_obligation_starts.
    *a party* does deliver goods with description *a description* on day *a day*; known as does_deliver_goods.
    something happens on day *a day*; known as something_happens_on_day.
    *a party* does something on day *a day*; known as does_something_on_day.
    the clock reaches day *a day*; known as the_clock_reaches_day.
    the contract delivery within days starts on day *a day* with deadline *a deadline*; known as contract_delivery_within_days_starts.
    the contract sale contract starts on day *a day* with price *a price*; known as contract_sale_contract_starts.
    *a party* does pay invoice with amount *an amount* on day *a day*; known as does_pay_invoice.
    the contract mutual obligations starts on day *a day*; known as contract_mutual_obligations_starts.
    the contract flexible delivery starts on day *a day*; known as contract_flexible_delivery_starts.
    the contract conditional delivery starts on day *a day* with urgent *an urgent*; known as contract_conditional_delivery_starts.
    the contract minimum payment contract starts on day *a day*; known as contract_minimum_payment_contract_starts.
    the contract exact payment required starts on day *a day* with required amount *a required amount*; known as contract_exact_payment_required_starts.
    the contract create order contract starts on day *a day* with order type *an order type* and price *a price*; known as contract_create_order_contract_starts.

the fluents are:
    simple delivery obligation obliges *a party* to deliver goods with description *a description* by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_simple_delivery_obligation_1.
    delivery within days obliges *a party* to deliver goods with description *a description* by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_delivery_within_days_1.
    sale contract obliges *a party* to deliver goods with description *a description* by day *a due day* as its first obligation given price *a price*; known as o_sale_contract_1.
    the first joint part of mutual obligations obliges *a party* to deliver goods with description *a description* by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_mutual_obligations_and1_1.
    the second joint part of mutual obligations obliges *a party* to pay invoice with amount *an amount* by day *a due day* as its second obligation; known as o_mutual_obligations_and2_2.
    the first alternative part of flexible delivery obliges *a party* to deliver goods with description *a description* by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_flexible_delivery_or1_1.
    the second alternative part of flexible delivery obliges *a party* to deliver goods with description *a description* by day *a due day* as its second obligation; known as o_flexible_delivery_or2_2.
    conditional delivery obliges *a party* to deliver goods with description *a description* by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_conditional_delivery_1.
    conditional delivery obliges *a party* to deliver goods with description *a description* by day *a due day* as its second obligation; known as o_conditional_delivery_2.
    minimum payment contract obliges *a party* to pay invoice by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_minimum_payment_contract_1.
    exact payment required obliges *a party* to pay invoice with amount *an amount* by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_exact_payment_required_1.
    create order contract obliges *a party* to deliver goods with description *a description* by day *a due day* as its first obligation given price *a price*; known as o_create_order_contract_1.
    create order contract obliges *a party* to deliver goods with description *a description* by day *a due day* as its second obligation given price *a price*; known as o_create_order_contract_2.
    the contract is fulfilled; known as the_contract_is_fulfilled.
    the contract is breached; known as the_contract_is_breached.
    sale contract obliges *a party* to pay invoice by day *a due day* as its second obligation; known as o_sale_contract_2.
    the contract is breached by *a party* because *a reason*; known as the_contract_is_breached_by_because.
    the first joint part of the contract is fulfilled; known as the_first_joint_part_is_fulfilled.
    the first joint part of the contract is breached; known as the_first_joint_part_is_breached.
    the second joint part of the contract is fulfilled; known as the_second_joint_part_is_fulfilled.
    the second joint part of the contract is breached; known as the_second_joint_part_is_breached.
    the first alternative part of the contract is fulfilled; known as the_first_alternative_part_is_fulfilled.
    the first alternative part of the contract is breached; known as the_first_alternative_part_is_breached.
    the second alternative part of the contract is fulfilled; known as the_second_alternative_part_is_fulfilled.
    the second alternative part of the contract is breached; known as the_second_alternative_part_is_breached.
    create order contract obliges *a party* to pay invoice by day *a due day* as its third obligation; known as o_create_order_contract_3.
    create order contract obliges *a party* to pay invoice by day *a due day* as its fourth obligation; known as o_create_order_contract_4.

