something happens on day a day from a time to a second time if
    the clock reaches day the day from the time to the second time.

something happens on day a day from a time to a second time if
    a party does deliver goods with description a description on day the day from the time to the second time.

a party does something on day a day from a time to a second time if
    the party does deliver goods with description a description on day the day from the time to the second time.

something happens on day a day from a time to a second time if
    a party does pay invoice with amount an amount on day the day from the time to the second time.

a party does something on day a day from a time to a second time if
    the party does pay invoice with amount an amount on day the day from the time to the second time.

% The contract simple delivery obligation starts: its first obligations.
when the contract simple delivery obligation starts on day a day
    and a due day = day + 14
then simple delivery obligation obliges seller to deliver goods with description "standard package" by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The contract delivery within days starts: its first obligations.
when the contract delivery within days starts on day a day with deadline a deadline
    and a due day = day + deadline
then delivery within days obliges seller to deliver goods with description "standard package" by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The contract sale contract starts: its first obligations.
when the contract sale contract starts on day a day with price a price
    and a due day = day + 14
then sale contract obliges seller to deliver goods with description "merchandise" by day the due day as its first obligation given price the price.

% The contract mutual obligations starts: its first obligations.
when the contract mutual obligations starts on day a day
    and a due day = day + 14
    and a second due day = day + 30
then the first joint part of mutual obligations obliges seller to deliver goods with description "item A" by day the due day as its first obligation
    and the second joint part of mutual obligations obliges buyer to pay invoice with amount 1000 by day the second due day as its second obligation.

% The contract flexible delivery starts: its first obligations.
when the contract flexible delivery starts on day a day
    and a due day = day + 7
    and a second due day = day + 14
then the first alternative part of flexible delivery obliges seller to deliver goods with description "express shipping" by day the due day as its first obligation
    and the second alternative part of flexible delivery obliges seller to deliver goods with description "standard shipping" by day the second due day as its second obligation.

% The contract conditional delivery starts: its first obligations.
when the contract conditional delivery starts on day a day with urgent an urgent
    and the urgent is equal to true
    and a due day = day + 3
then conditional delivery obliges seller to deliver goods with description "urgent delivery" by day the due day as its first obligation.

when the contract conditional delivery starts on day a day with urgent an urgent
    and the urgent is different from true
    and a due day = day + 14
then conditional delivery obliges seller to deliver goods with description "standard delivery" by day the due day as its second obligation.

% The contract minimum payment contract starts: its first obligations.
when the contract minimum payment contract starts on day a day
    and a due day = day + 30
then minimum payment contract obliges buyer to pay invoice by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The contract exact payment required starts: its first obligations.
when the contract exact payment required starts on day a day with required amount a required amount
    and a due day = day + 30
then exact payment required obliges buyer to pay invoice with amount the required amount by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The contract create order contract starts: its first obligations.
when the contract create order contract starts on day a day with order type an order type and price a price
    and the order type is equal to "express"
    and a due day = day + 3
then create order contract obliges seller to deliver goods with description "express order" by day the due day as its first obligation given price the price.

when the contract create order contract starts on day a day with order type an order type and price a price
    and the order type is different from "express"
    and a due day = day + 14
then create order contract obliges seller to deliver goods with description "standard order" by day the due day as its second obligation given price the price.

% The first obligation of simple delivery obligation: met, or its deadline missed.
when a party does deliver goods with description a description on day a day
    and simple delivery obligation obliges the party to deliver goods with description the description by day a due day as its first obligation
    and the day <= the due day
then the contract is fulfilled
    and it is not the case that simple delivery obligation obliges the party to deliver goods with description the description by day the due day as its first obligation.

when something happens on day a day
    and simple delivery obligation obliges a party to deliver goods with description a description by day a due day as its first obligation
    and the day > the due day
then the contract is breached
    and it is not the case that simple delivery obligation obliges the party to deliver goods with description the description by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The first obligation of delivery within days: met, or its deadline missed.
when a party does deliver goods with description a description on day a day
    and delivery within days obliges the party to deliver goods with description the description by day a due day as its first obligation
    and the day <= the due day
then the contract is fulfilled
    and it is not the case that delivery within days obliges the party to deliver goods with description the description by day the due day as its first obligation.

when something happens on day a day
    and delivery within days obliges a party to deliver goods with description a description by day a due day as its first obligation
    and the day > the due day
then the contract is breached
    and it is not the case that delivery within days obliges the party to deliver goods with description the description by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The first obligation of sale contract: met, or its deadline missed.
when a party does deliver goods with description a description on day a day
    and sale contract obliges the party to deliver goods with description the description by day a due day as its first obligation given price a price
    and the day <= the due day
    and a second due day = day + 30
then sale contract obliges buyer to pay invoice by day the second due day as its second obligation
    and it is not the case that sale contract obliges the party to deliver goods with description the description by day the due day as its first obligation given price the price.

when something happens on day a day
    and sale contract obliges a party to deliver goods with description a description by day a due day as its first obligation given price a price
    and the day > the due day
then the contract is breached by seller because "failed to deliver"
    and it is not the case that sale contract obliges the party to deliver goods with description the description by day the due day as its first obligation given price the price.

% The first obligation of mutual obligations: met, or its deadline missed.
when a party does deliver goods with description a description on day a day
